close_reason: "Compatible dependency remediation restored strict security and automatic release preparation; independent tag, GitHub release, and npm checks confirm no publication."
body: "## Reproduction\\n\\nA clean frozen install followed by bun audit fails with one high advisory in the Vitest toolchain. Patch the compatible transitive version, refresh current compatible tooling and PM CLI, then prove clean security and dry-run release gates without publishing."
